tps:\/\/api.sketchfab.com\/v3\/users\/cc0c91717f3b4bbd838665de2492a1fa"},"description":"**Bia \u0111\u00e1 Ch\u00f9a Thi\u00ean M\u1ee5 (1715) - Ng\u1ef1 ki\u1ebfn Thi\u00ean M\u1ee5 t\u1ef1 | 1715 Royal Stele - Thien Mu Pagoda**\n\nM\u00f4 h\u00ecnh 3D ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1ng Bia \u0111\u00e1 t\u1ea1i ch\u00f9a Thi\u00ean M\u1ee5 (Hu\u1ebf), d\u1ef1ng n\u0103m 1715 th\u1eddi Ch\u00faa Nguy\u1ec5n Ph\u00fac Chu. Bia kh\u1eafc b\u00e0i v\u0103n \"Ng\u1ef1 ki\u1ebfn Thi\u00ean M\u1ee5 t\u1ef1\" do ch\u00ednh Ch\u00faa so\u1ea1n th\u1ea3o, ca ng\u1ee3i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 linh thi\u00eang c\u1ee7a ng\u00f4i ch\u00f9a. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 B\u1ea3o v\u1eadt qu\u1ed1c gia v\u1edbi ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt ch\u1ea1m kh\u1eafc r\u1ed3ng, r\u00f9a \u0111\u1ed9i bia tinh x\u1ea3o. M\u00f4 h\u00ecnh chu\u1ea9n PBR, t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n chi ti\u1ebft b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t \u0111\u00e1 Thanh c\u1ed5 k\u00ednh v\u00e0 minh v\u0103n.\n\nA 3D reconstruction of the 1715 Stone Stele at Thien Mu Pagoda, Hue, erected by Lord Nguyen Phuc Chu. It is engraved with the royal essay \"Ngu kien Thien Mu tu\", praising the pagoda's sacred beauty. A National Treasure showcasing 18th-century stone carving mastery, featuring a turtle base and intricate dragon motifs. High-quality PBR model for digital heritage and historical research.","faceCount":1146806,"createdAt":"2026-03-19T16:17:10.727332","vertexCount":573816,"isAgeRestricted":false,"archives":{},"license":null}]}